# Personal markers for the privacy guard (scripts/check-public.mjs).
# Copy this file to .private-markers (git-ignored) and put your own values in it.
# One marker per line. Empty lines and lines that start with # are skipped.
#
# A plain line is matched as text, case-insensitive:
Jane Example
jane.example@example.com
My Secret Road Trip Mix
#
# A line like /pattern/flags is a JavaScript regex. Use \b for numbers,
# for example your library size with or without a thousands separator:
/\b12,?345\b/
